  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-S41lDQhP\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-JRckqANI\">本文介绍如何「获取飞书webhook url」</p></blockquote><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%229EqZD%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-rU9cfO0W%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3Ewebhook%20Url%20%E4%BD%9C%E7%94%A8%3C%2Fstrong%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E8%84%9A%E6%9C%AC%E8%BF%90%E8%A1%8C%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87weebhook%20url%E5%9B%9E%E8%B0%83%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%86%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E6%8E%A8%E9%80%81%E8%87%B3%E9%A3%9E%E4%B9%A6%E7%BE%A4%EF%BC%8C%E4%BE%BF%E4%BA%8E%E5%9C%A8%E9%A3%9E%E4%B9%A6%E7%BE%A4%E6%9F%A5%E7%9C%8B%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E3%80%82%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" p-id=\"13148\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-rU9cfO0W\"><strong>webhook Url 作用</strong>：当脚本运行输出结果后，可通过weebhook url回调的方式，将结果推送至飞书群，便于在飞书群查看数据。</p></div></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-STopyCck\"><strong>第一步：创建飞书群</strong></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-mGevvqIL\">首先，创建一个需要接收消息的飞书群</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-xBu0v8kF\"><br></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-qo8JCgsJ\"><strong>第二步：在飞书群内添加机器人</strong></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-iixEyWLh\">最终消息会通过机器人在群内推送</p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table\" data-id=\"tdde8e29-NScKiAG3\" data-custom=\"false\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-hci8DVnP\"><col span=\"1\" data-id=\"c0e23c14-T5MQQR14\" width=\"38.047682597265855%\"><col span=\"1\" data-id=\"cc351559-R5TRCXLB\" width=\"61.952317402734145%\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-YLFCeY5W\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-AShmgP5A\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-gj61QYTP\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-gWSyCqWX\">通过群右上角“...”进入添加机器人页面</p></td><td data-id=\"t1b895c3-H8eNaD6h\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-saORRkM2\"><img src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/5a6df8834b1e4e8bad6709150162e28c~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2026437581&amp;x-signature=2QXCyMaH0KyKfdiWoCUQPMqcJ9A%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"visibility: visible; width: 525px; height: 512px;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-Zblb8U5f\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-XQ9bBbB8\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" class=\"\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-j6s7VFZr\">1、添加机器人</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-kf3HzC5e\">2、选择自定义机器儿</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-xh1fzWkC\">3、填写机器人名称、头像、描述</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-24gOhABu\">4、添加机器人</p></td><td data-id=\"t1b895c3-JP6AhKXE\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZXsNtMpc\"><img src=\"https://p26-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/bb9e3d743f124133ac01a1e2e0426368~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2026437613&amp;x-signature=x43EE2uB1FEiVNYKidK104OyZ0U%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"visibility: visible; width: 525px; height: 514px;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-q2hhGd6T\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://p26-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/4d9bbbaaed6c49e3afaf0b6a9e648298~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2026437647&amp;x-signature=BKJBp6QGg5km5ulDnhqmbO17OaM%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"visibility: visible; width: 383.551px; height: 600px;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-kqNltyuS\"><img src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4l